Define function a taking n as i64 returning i64:
    If n is 0:
        Return 1.
    Return b(n - 1).
Define function b taking n as i64 returning i64:
    If n is 0:
        Return 1.
    Return c(n - 1).
Define function c taking n as i64 returning i64:
    If n is 0:
        Return 1.
    Return a(n - 1).
Return a(9).
